<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS UP AT $61-3/8 (FIM 311.00).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS UP AT $61-3/8 (FIM 311.00).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed $1-5/8 higher at $61-3/8 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 311.00 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Wednesday, Nokia A closed down 1.00 markka at 305.00 markka.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed up $0-3/8 at $37-3/4 on Wall Street. The price equals about 95.70 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed flat at 95.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded in New York on Wednesday. In Helsinki on Wednesday, Rauma closed down 0.50 markka at 115.50.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
